        "code": {
          "text": "Left ear pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "For the last 3–4 days, dull left ear ache rated 3–4/10."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left ear blocked sensation and reduced hearing"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "For the last 3–4 days, the left ear has felt blocked with reduced hearing. Patient reports sounds through the cochlear implant are more muffled when the ear condition flares."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Associated symptoms and pertinent negatives"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No right ear pain, otorrhoea, vertigo, new tinnitus, facial weakness, or mastoid pain. No cough, sore throat, or runny nose."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Home temperature and general symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports mild temperatures at home up to 37.8 °C and feeling a bit tired and unwell; eating and drinking okay."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-11",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Prior response to antibiotic course"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "After the previous amoxicillin course, pain and fevers had settled and symptoms were much better by day 3; patient reports taking every dose. Symptoms have recurred."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
