        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Canal patent with mild erythema and no discharge. Tympanic membrane partly obscured by moist debris; visible parts dull and erythematous with mild bulge and decreased light reflex. No clear perforation seen."
